	# The embedded Mercure hub is off: this Caddy module is 1.1.4 now, and it dropped the shape of
	# the configuration below. `demo` became `playground`, and `publisher_jwt`/`subscriber_jwt` live
	# only in compatibility mode, which still demands an issuer identifier — so the hub refused to
	# provision and FrankenPHP exited 1 on every boot. Nothing in src/ or templates/ publishes to
	# Mercure, so this costs the application nothing today. Turning it back on means an `issuer`
	# block here, a `transport` directive in place of the Dockerfile's MERCURE_TRANSPORT_URL, and
